n as one for all Nana was known for  her commitment to justice and for always  doing her best to help others with a  smile on her face but sadly some time  after transferring her quark on to all  Mike she was murdered by the mastermind  behind the league of villains when she  had one for all just like all might she  had superhuman strength speed agility  and reflexes we can assume that along  with one for all Nana Shimura had a  second work but we have no idea what  type of work it was also in season three  we will likely get glimpses of some of  the UA students parents this includes  Jiro's dad who is a rock star and baku  goes mom and dad by the way baku goes  mom seems like an even bigger badass  than baku go now season 3 might end  after the hideout ray dark but it might  also go into the hero license exam mark  where we get to meet characters from  other Japanese hero schools we will meet  Emmy fuku kado aka miss joke the smile  hero a teacher at katsu bhutesu Academy  miss joke is a young pro hero with a  great sense of humor and a cheerful  attitude she has known Eraserhead for a  long time they used to work near each  other and miss jokes seems to enjoy  flirting with him even though he doesn't  return her flirtatiousness the name of  her quirk is outburst its type is  emitter and it is said to have the  ability to force people around her to  laugh to the point that they can no  longer control themselves and so she can  literally paralyzed villains with  laughter when I first read about her  quirk in Chapter 103 I couldn't help but  think of the  Joker from Batman and his laughing gas  that he uses as a weapon  also from katsu bhutesu Academy we have  Yeol Shindo a sly and determined  second-year student with a powerful  quirk the name of his quirk is shake its  type is emitter and it works at long  range as a result of his quirk Shindo  can generate powerful earthquakes when  he makes contact with the ground and he  is generally able to control the  intensi